==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Shellder|129}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*'''Tongue Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Lickitung|41}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
